{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand Crafted World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>Scarred Lands</strong>, a hand crafted world full of things to find and uncover. Traverse the landscape by unlocking areas and platforming between locations with a new item around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/5ea70a6389bb124f292c32dc5fe14dba.poster.avif?t=1774375197\" width=542 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/5ea70a6389bb124f292c32dc5fe14dba.webm?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/5ea70a6389bb124f292c32dc5fe14dba.mp4?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Parry Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, dodge, and parry enemies breaking down their health, parry enemies to break their stance and go in for heavy damaging blows. Not all attacks can be parried due to being too powerful so you must dodge out of the way to avoid it. Each sword has a unique <strong>weapon art</strong> that does high damage or provides a buff in differing ways to give more unique build opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/99574c788c3f59bfe387a322c17b0b63.poster.avif?t=1774375197\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/99574c788c3f59bfe387a322c17b0b63.webm?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/99574c788c3f59bfe387a322c17b0b63.mp4?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade using <strong>voltage</strong> taken from the death of enemies or finding <strong>voltage</strong> items through out the <strong>Scarred Lands</strong>. Use this currency to upgrade your attributes to become stronger and do more damage. You can also use it to upgrade weapons when you find the right materials.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/05c4052c7683de6b0dcd0f95ecd9ef5f.poster.avif?t=1774375197\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/05c4052c7683de6b0dcd0f95ecd9ef5f.webm?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/05c4052c7683de6b0dcd0f95ecd9ef5f.mp4?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Secrets of this World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Scarred Lands</strong> contains futuristic sci fi technology stuck in a medieval like age due to fast development and evolution of their technology. A place lost to war plunged into ruin. <strong>Lord Abaddon</strong> of the <strong>Saurian Empire</strong> seeks to enact revenge on the people of the world for doing nothing as the <strong>Saurians</strong> starved in their icy prison. He took control of all the lands beneath the <strong>Ivory Towers</strong> but is now locked in stalemate. The war drags on, the fighting all but ceased, starvation and disease has wiped out most of what was left after the initial fighting. <strong>Lord Abaddon</strong> still hopes to lead his people to a new paradise and his people fight on, slaughtering those in the way. Despite the mistakes of the past you must fight the evil that threatens to turn the world to ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/00bf81a0c31a969fa283997097631fa0.poster.avif?t=1774375197\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/00bf81a0c31a969fa283997097631fa0.webm?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/extras/00bf81a0c31a969fa283997097631fa0.mp4?t=1774375197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977090?t=1774375197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977090?t=1774375197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/38a4e37bbdbb9f7313123c3e33983b33c64da17d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774375197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977090/38a4e37bbdbb9f7313123c3e33983b33c64da17d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774375197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppor